# Copy to /etc/default/metaforge-grading on the VPS, populate, chmod 0640.
# Do NOT set GRADING_SECRET_FILE here either: the unit passes the secret as a systemd
# credential and sets it inline; a value here would override that. deploy.sh strips it.
# Do NOT set PYTHONPATH here. The systemd unit sets it via Environment= to pin the
# .worktrees/next deploy worktree, and an EnvironmentFile PYTHONPATH would OVERRIDE
# that inline value at runtime (sending the sidecar's code + data resolution back to
# the wrong checkout). deploy.sh strips any PYTHONPATH from the live /etc/default for
# this reason. Manual (non-systemd) runs must export PYTHONPATH=<worktree>/data-pipeline/ themselves.
